      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 01 \u2014 Character Creation\n\nBuilds one consistent fictional character from a text description, converging on a single canonical identity instead of 7 different-looking people.\n\n**This is a two-phase, manual-approval workflow** (ComfyUI has no built-in 'pause for human review' node, so approval happens between two Queue Prompt runs):\n\n1. **Phase A (this side):** describe the character in the Krea 2 Large node's prompt and generate seed candidates. Queue it a few times (different random seeds) to get several options, saved under `output/projects/<project>/outputs/images/candidates/`.\n2. **Pick the best one.** Copy that PNG into `input/ai_influencer/<project>/references/canonical/front.png`.\n3. **Phase B (right side):** point the Load Image node at that file and Queue again. GPT Image 2.5 edits it into 6 more consistent angles using it as the identity reference \u2014 the strongest available identity-lock without a trainable LoRA (none of Krea 2 / GPT Image 2.5 / Seedance 2.5's cloud APIs expose one; see README_AI_INFLUENCER.md).\n\nSet the **project** field on every Save & Log / Load Character node to the same name (or set AI_INFLUENCER_DEFAULT_PROJECT in .env once)."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
